Track Popularity by Artist (Area / Line Chart)

This chart visualizes the sum of track popularity for each artist.

Purpose:

Identify artists with the most popular tracks

Compare engagement levels across artists

Observe popularity distribution trends

This visualization helps determine which artists have the highest cumulative popularity scores.

